          "Do not compare this outage follow-up accuracy result with an outside benchmark unless definitions match. A local rate speaks only for the cases sampled in that period. CustomerSuccessManagers labels it local evidence and records the production date. That label keeps a modest finding from becoming a claim it cannot carry. Escalate the pattern rather than the individual case when the same gap recurs.",
          "A good finding changes one decision the team can name in advance. If the result would not alter a review, a queue rule, or an escalation, it is measuring curiosity. CustomerSuccessManagers writes the intended decision beside the measure before collection. That sentence keeps a tidy report from replacing action. Record the reviewer and the time of the observation so a later question has somewhere to land."
