          "Eligible items come from churn records closed during the observation window. Report three figures together: the share meeting the rule, the count of absent sources, and the median age of open items. Every figure needs its denominator and the dates it covers. A number without those companions cannot support a decision. Keep the note short enough to read during a live account conversation and specific enough to test afterward.",
          "Set the population before selecting the first item. Record each exclusion and why it was excluded, including owner changes. A sample pulled from the calmest queue will flatter any control. The aim is an accurate account of arriving work, not an attractive sample. Leave the exception visible until an accountable owner accepts the next action in writing. Leave the exception visible until an accountable owner accepts the next action in writing.",
