          "Decide what finished means before drawing any sample. Here, finished requires a dated source and an identified reviewer behind the measure. A tracker entry marked done cannot excuse a missing source. CustomerSuccessManagers displays the tracker value and the evidence together so the gap is visible. Write the system field name instead of a description so the note and the extract use one vocabulary.",
          "Each item records source, observation time, supported field, and reviewer. Keep missing, unavailable, and confirmed-negative as separate values. Merging them hides whether evidence was absent or simply uncollected. Agree the value list before collection so the extract does not drift. A monthly sample reveals whether the rule survives a heavy week with partial coverage. A monthly sample reveals whether the rule survives a heavy week with partial coverage."
