          "Name an accountable owner and a date for the next review. End with one action: fix the source, tighten the field, change the queue, or pause for a decision. CustomerSuccessManagers reruns the same protocol after the change rather than inventing a new one. The next sample reuses the population rule and codebook. Record the reviewer and the time of the observation so a later question has somewhere to land.",
